**Changes to the upstream AGPL bundles.** At build time `tools/build.mjs` makes one change to each
of the prebuilt `dist/web` bundles. It replaces webpack's fixed public path `"/"` with the folder of
the loading script, so the code-split chunks load from the same folder.

The exact upstream tarballs are fetched with `npm pack` into `vendor/`. They are listed in
`vendor/SHA512SUMS`, and the service that runs Wonder Lab mirrors them next to the built page.

